%S A399406 1,5,2,11,8,3,19,17,12,4,26,28,23,15,6,35,40,37,31,20,7,45,51,52,48,
%T A399406 38,24,9,57,64,69,67,59,46,29,10,66,79,86,87,81,71,54,33,13,76,93,104,
